          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "In the present study high-temperature compression tests on a chromium-alloyed ternary eutectic V-9Si-6.5B are reported. The ternary eutectic composition is located within the VSS (V solid-solution)-V3Si-V5SiB2 three-phase region of the respective V-rich corner of the phase diagram.",
